WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.429
Warehouse putaway in Quark WMS. This example follows
storage placement on an RF terminal.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.447
Follow the pallet identification, stock confirmation and
destination steps shown in this recording.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.008
Open Putaway from the RF inventory menu.

4
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.155
Identify the pallet by its license plate number, or LPN.

5
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.903
Review the pallet details and confirm the stock.

6
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.757
Move to the destination shown on the RF screen, then
confirm the warehouse location.

7
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.374
The Put Away screen confirms the placement at the selected
location.
